    "problem": "The paper addresses the limited attention given to the Eastern Mediterranean and Middle East, a climate change \"hot spot,\" by the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change, necessitating a comprehensive regional assessment to understand the disproportionate impacts of future warming, droughts, and extreme weather conditions.",
    "method": "This study assesses climate change in the Eastern Mediterranean and Middle East by analyzing long-term meteorological and proxy datasets with regional climate model projections for the 21st century under the IPCC SRES A1B scenario.",
    "task": "The task is to analyze historical meteorological data and project 21st-century climate change and its impacts in the Eastern Mediterranean and the Middle East using regional climate model projections based on the IPCC SRES A1B scenario.",
